{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_03_beg","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":6,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_02_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-3","storyName":"跌落保护","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"衰老的女妖客人朦胧地回忆起她与娜斯提的过往，跌跌撞撞地向莱茵生态园奔去。另一边，费尔南被梅希亚引导着来到贵宾室寻找线索，在这里见到了被监禁的奥克里，两人一起逃跑。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_03_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":4,"next":6,"characters":["拂哀菈","石翼魔","？？？","幼小的女妖","娜斯提","园区警卫","高登","费尔南","梅希亚","研究员","斯凯","奥克里"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_49_g1_kazdelroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"false","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"感谢招待。","id":13},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"charslot","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2043_1#1$1","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"石翼魔","text":"客气什么，这些年难得还能见到女妖，我高兴还来不及。","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"高兴又是为何？","id":20},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2043_1#1$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"石翼魔","text":"这样我们也算认识了。等我或我的家人活到头了，也好请你来唱挽歌。","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"石翼魔","text":"这年头，卡兹戴尔还是那个卡兹戴尔，但很少有女妖会来了。","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"石翼魔","text":"没你们引渡，死去的同胞会找不到众魂的。","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"抱歉。","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"我会......尽我所能。","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2043_1#1$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"石翼魔","text":"哈哈，我开玩笑的。你来，是为了给你们那棵“栖脚树”治病吧？","id":32},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2043_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2043_1#1$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"石翼魔","text":"这就是它的枝条？","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"我们试过用咒言解析，但找不出它枯败的缘由。","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"所幸，有朋友介绍了您这样一位熟识草木的土石之子。它是女妖一族生活的依凭，请务必——","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2043_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"石翼魔","text":"我会帮忙。等我备上土......","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2043_1#1$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"石翼魔","text":"方便的话，帮我去后院拿个盆？可能会有几只来偷菜的羽兽，赶走就是。","id":46},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":49},{"type":"charslot","id":50},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_bg_49_g4_kazdelstreet_shabby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_magic_m","volume":"1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"“散去。”","id":57},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wing","volume":"1","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"羽兽四散惊飞，破败的菜园却没有归于平静，一株菜苗在拂哀菈面前剧烈地摇晃着。","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"而后，在沾满尘埃的叶片之间，缓缓浮现出枝条般的黑色尖角。","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"“偷菜的羽兽”......吗？","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"滚开，不然我把你脑袋拧下来。","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"这样扯着喉咙吓唬人，对嗓子不好的。","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"别害怕，好吗？我无意伤害一个孩子。","id":70},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hidehaystack","volume":"0.6","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,0","isblock":"true","id":74},{"type":"text","text":"幼小的女妖从叶片后面探出头来，下意识地把啃了一半的菜叶藏在了身后。","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"也别打我的菜叶的主意。","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"......假如那是“你”的菜叶的话。","id":78},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#5$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"你拿的什么？","id":81},{"type":"dialog","id":82},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"text","text":"拂哀菈反应过来时，小女妖已经一把抢过她手中栖脚树的枝条，费劲地咧开嘴，试图从上面啃下点什么。","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#6$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"呸。就是泥地里的普通树枝，都发臭了。","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"饿了吗？稍等......雾湖边的露盏草刚刚成熟，出发前我还采来做了些糕点......","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#9$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"从死人身上扒吃的还更安全点。能不能别缠着我了？","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#6$1","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_enchantress_threat","volume":"0.6","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"（威胁的低啸）","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"......","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#10$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"......你不害怕？明明就连那些大块头佣兵都怕这种声音。","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"这是女妖的声音，我们族群的声音。","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"我已经很久不曾在女妖曲中听到这个音符了。上一次唱出它的那个人，几年前就......","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"......你就是那个孩子。","id":106},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#5$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"教我这种声音的人，你认识她？","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"但我从没见过你。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"我们已经不常在卡兹戴尔行走。我们住在遥远的河谷，一个长着很多大树，能结出很多果子的地方。","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#3$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"吃上饭是要费劲的，要挨打的。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#1$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"如果有你说的那种地方，果子就那么白白结出来......那代价是什么？","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"......真是聪明的孩子。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"或许，你该跟我回去，你属于那里，你会喜欢那里。","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"哪怕你不相信那里存在。","id":123},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#1$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"幼小的女妖","text":"我凭什么相信？","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"你的名字......是娜斯提，对吗？","id":128},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2052_1#5$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"——！","id":131},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plantwither_slow","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":140},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#4$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"那个方向......有女妖的气息？还有......什么东西，在枯萎、腐败？","id":143},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#4$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"不......娜斯提，你难道......","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#4$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"要重蹈覆辙？","id":149},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crutch_snow","volume":"0.8","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#4$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2.5","isblock":"true","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":155},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":160},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":163},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$act15_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_sys_act15_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":164,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"高登长官，莱茵常规人员已全部从生态园撤出，娜斯提和少数研究员正在整理资料——他们的脸色很不好看。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你很高兴？我们的原计划可不是端掉一整个生态园。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"您说过，那个导游对女妖太过了解，借今天的机会正好可以谎称她与娜斯提来往密切，再揭穿她的假身份——一举两得。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"那个计划本来就不够缜密，现在生态园出了事故，不是正好能顺水推舟地终止莱茵的检修吗？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"顺水推舟？那你告诉我，那个该死的导游去哪儿了？！","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"这......","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"以娜斯提的能力和作风，她不可能让生态园出现那么大的纰漏。况且展会开幕在即，她绝不可能拿莱茵的展品冒险。","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"那个导游......她在警报响起之前就不见了！","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"她一定做了什么。","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"光撤走几个研究员是不够的，娜斯提大概率已经猜出了我的计划，只差人证物证......我不能把把柄送到她的手上。","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"通知你手下的人，天黑之前，必须找到费尔南。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"是！","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":201},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":202,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","isblock":"true","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"冷静一点费尔南，说不定是客人自己跑出去了......","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"不可能，她连来“螺旋桨天堂”的理由都忘了，现在还能去哪儿？","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#10$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1.8","isblock":"true","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"但如果她不是......","id":210},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那只可能是有人把她带走了。","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"谁！","id":215},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"1","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":219},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","duration":"1.2","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"费尔南小姐。","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你怎么会......在这儿？","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":231},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_530_1#1$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"研究员","text":"还愣着干嘛！优先移栽展会要用的实验品，那是我们仅剩的一批幼苗了——","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_530_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#13$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"仅仅五分钟......全枯死了？","id":238},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"text","text":"梅希亚伸手抚摸生态园中央的枯树，在目光所及的高度，一个狭小的孔洞吸引了梅希亚的目光。","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#12$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"自然生出的树洞......不对，是个接口？","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"枯萎，树洞，设备没有故障......告诉我，接在你身上的那根“树枝”是什么，它又去了哪儿？","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#7$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"......","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"是费尔南小姐！","id":249},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"charslot","id":254},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":255},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":256},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"你手里的那支骨笔，是从生态园的树上取下来的，对吗？","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"它朴素、简单、很不起眼，外人不会意识到它是生态园运作的一道“密钥”，你并非有意破坏。","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"......高登长官的警卫是不是已经在门外了？","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"只有我一个人。费尔南小姐，我认为生态园事故的责任不应该由你承担。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"什么意思......？","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"有些事我还未求证，但恐怕，从无故答应帮助那位神秘的女妖客人开始，高登长官就在酝酿对付莱茵的计划，又或者为自己谋取利益......","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你在怀疑自己的上司？可他说过哥伦比亚不会亏待好人。","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"他也说过，在哥伦比亚最容易对付的也是好人。","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"那我的客人......","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"长官的办公区域外有一排特殊的“贵宾室”，您可以去那里确认。","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我希望您的客人只是想出门透透气，我真的希望。","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"......","id":283},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":285},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":292},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_bg_38_g5_rhinelab_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":293},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$escape_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":294,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"岂有此理，一定是高登搞的鬼！","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"先是调整工程检修的名单，现在干脆毁掉生态园，封锁莱茵展区......下一步他还想做什么，把我们都赶出“螺旋桨天堂”吗？","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我们的系统硬件没有出现任何问题。","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"他派人偷了你的骨笔。","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不像他的作风。","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"为什么要去理解强盗的逻辑？","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"除了打官腔的时候，他跟我们就不在同一套规则里——园区的所有企业都跟我们不在一套规则里。","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我们是最接近阻隔层的人，我们必然与众不同。","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"被淘汰的科技公司数不胜数，但注册大厅极少收到投诉，为什么？","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"因为园区的所有人都有一个共识——趋向天空的时代，谁站得更高，谁就应该获得尊重。","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"高登蓄意阻碍我们的实验，已经违反了园区的基本共识，那么他理应......","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不想被规则束缚，却又想利用规则。","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你的话充分证明了莱茵还不足以站得那么高。","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"什么......","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"各位，麻烦停下手中的工作。针对今天的事故，我需要向大家通报之后的安排。","id":328},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"charslot","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_530_1#1$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.2","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_529_1#1$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":333},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","isblock":"true","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我与培养组的几位研究员多次确认，生态园中的七十二棵待移栽的乔木，三百五十株植物幼苗，近千枚正在萌发的种子，已全部枯死。","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"园区的警卫力量会全权负责生态园事故的调查，调查时长尚不确定，但可以肯定的是，生态园无法赶在展会开始前恢复原貌。","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我需要高年资的研究员跟我一起整理事故报告，其他同事可以享受短暂的假期。还有什么问题吗？","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"娜斯提主任，你之前说过这座生态园是我们最重要的项目，它是环形实验室传回的数据凝聚的成果。","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"所以这意味着，我们连万星园最后的遗产都没能守住，对吗？","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"......","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"解散。","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":359},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"办公区域外的贵宾室......到了。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"梅希亚小姐也只是怀疑，并不能说明高登长官真的......只要能把客人找回来，比什么都强！","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.2","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......让你再跑，看我不打死你！","id":369},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"房间里有人？","id":372},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.3","isblock":"true","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":375},{"type":"charslot","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"80,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"*哥伦比亚粗口*整天哭哭啼啼的，老老实实被关到展会结束不好吗？","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","id":382},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"头疼，让我抽根烟缓缓。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":388},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"......","id":392},{"type":"dialog","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":398},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"长官行行好，放我走吧，我不会把高登长官的失误说出去的......","id":400},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"怎么是你？睁开眼睛，奥克里！","id":403},{"type":"dialog","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"冒牌货......","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"礼貌一点，叫我费尔南。","id":408},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"高登长官跟我说他要支付你一大笔补偿金，会好好对待你，可你怎么......","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"囚禁也能算待客之道吗？","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"要不是因为你假冒我的身份，根本不会有这档子事儿！","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"哦？那天晚上可是你一把鼻涕一把泪求着我把你的终端号和简历收下来的，你说自己太缺爱了，还说——","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"好了好了别说下去了！","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"唉，算我倒霉......让外人混进安全权限极高的实验园区可是重大疏漏，所以他们才想封我的口。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"倒是你，我刚才还听警卫说，今天高登长官要处理掉那个只会惹事的冒牌货......你逃出来了？","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"......原来如此。","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"唉，我们是不是没办法活着离开这里了？为了看看未来的生活是什么样，都快看不到未来了......","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"正牌货，你要不要加入我的旅行团？","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"什么？","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"既然我有本事神不知鬼不觉地混进来，就能保证把你安全送出去。","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"就凭你......？","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":435},{"type":"dialog","id":436},{"type":"charslot","id":437},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"妈的，就抽个烟的工夫，房间里还能长出个人？","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"行，那就都留在这儿吧！","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$indust_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_bat_indust_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":443,"musicid":4},{"type":"dialog","id":444},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_singleblunt","id":448},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":449},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"哈，来者不善啊......","id":452},{"type":"charslot","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","isblock":"true","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"冒、冒牌货，你刚说的算数？我愿意加入你的旅行团，快带我离开！","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":456},{"type":"charslot","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smashtable","id":459},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":460},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":461},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"太好了，你不会后悔的，我在骸骨荒原都能三进三出——","id":463},{"type":"dialog","id":464},{"type":"charslot","id":465},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"别说大话了，先搞定眼前这个大块头再说！啧，我的手还被绑着......","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"放心，一名优秀的导游怎么能麻烦客人呢？","id":469},{"type":"dialog","id":470},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":471},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":472},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"0.4","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"喂喂喂，欢迎您加入费尔南旅行团，友情提醒，接下来您会听到稍许噪音。","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"请捂好您的耳朵或者稍微离我远一点，我们准备出发了——","id":478},{"type":"dialog","id":479},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mictest","id":480},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":481},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.6","block":"true","id":482},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":483},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"呃......","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-150","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":487},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":488},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":489},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":490},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"-120,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.3","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"快走！","id":492},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":493},{"type":"dialog","id":494},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"-120,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"false","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-220,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":496},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":497},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","id":498},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","isblock":"true","id":499},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"*哥伦比亚粗口*给我追！一个都不能放跑。","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":502},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":503},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":504},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":505},{"type":"charslot","id":506},{"type":"background","id":507},{"type":"image","id":508}],"characters":["拂哀菈","石翼魔","？？？","幼小的女妖","娜斯提","园区警卫","高登","费尔南","梅希亚","研究员","斯凯","奥克里"]}